BestSecret’s invitation-only model creates a distinct product challenge: balancing the high-end, curated feel of a luxury boutique with the technical demands of a high-volume, pan-European e-commerce platform. Success in this environment requires more than just standard search and sort algorithms; it requires balancing brand exclusivity with the need for high-velocity conversion, ensuring that every result feels tailored to the member’s taste while minimizing the friction inherent in large-scale inventory discovery.

At Postscript, I navigated a similar tension by building an AI-powered message optimization engine for 18,000+ Shopify merchants. The goal was to increase SMS conversion without compromising brand voice. By implementing predictive analytics and generative AI to test hundreds of message variants, I drove a 28\% increase in earnings-per-message. I translated these complex engagement signals into re-engagement automation roadmaps, ensuring that our technical output directly supported the unique brand identity of each merchant. I bring this same rigor to BestSecret, where the search experience must act as the primary curator for your members.

To accelerate our delivery, I utilize agentic workflows—including Claude Code and MCP—to shorten the cycle between user feedback and technical implementation. This allows for faster experimentation cycles, enabling us to test search relevance and sorting logic in real-time. I am eager to apply this methodology to BestSecret’s search infrastructure, ensuring that our members consistently find relevant, premium inventory while we maintain the quiet exclusivity that defines your community.


\vspace{20pt}

Kind regards,

\vspace{1pt}

Rodrigo Lopes

